# 9. Scoped Development

Significant work should have agreed scope and acceptance criteria in an issue
or pull request. Individual planning records stay outside the public source.

A review should record:

```text
# Goal

# Developer story

# Scope

Included:
Excluded:

# Architecture

Affected packages:

# Proposed interface

# Acceptance criteria

[ ] implementation
[ ] unit tests
[ ] integration verification
[ ] documentation
[ ] example
[ ] agent guidance
[ ] knowledge/memory decision

# Sources / evidence

# Risks
```

This allows multiple contributors to work independently while following the same architectural contract.

