# 10. Review Model

Changes should be classified by risk.

## Level 1 — Low Risk

Examples:

```text
documentation
examples
minor DX changes
troubleshooting
```

Requires:

```text
review
CI
```

## Level 2 — Functional

Examples:

```text
SDK functionality
CLI
framework adapters
templates
developer tooling
```

Requires:

```text
defined task
tests
CODEOWNER review
CI
```

## Level 3 — Protocol-Sensitive

Examples:

```text
contract addresses
ABIs
financial calculations
transaction construction
write paths
security guidance
```

Requires:

```text
verified evidence
tests
integration verification
qualified review
CODEOWNER approval
```

