# 11. Definition of Done

Implementation alone does not complete an important feature.

A supported capability should normally include:

```text
implementation
+
tests
+
integration verification
+
documentation
+
example
+
agent guidance
+
knowledge/memory decision
```

Protocol-sensitive functionality additionally requires:

```text
source evidence
registry verification
qualified review
```

The documentation and agent instructions therefore evolve together with the implementation.

